                <pb facs="0834" n="824" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv08/pg824"/>

                <head>Appendix F to HD–78</head>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">polish affairs commission</hi></p>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">Note to the Supreme Council</hi></p>
                <list>
                    <label>1st)</label>
                    <item>an overture made by Mr. Dmowsky,</item>
                    <label>2nd)</label>
                    <item>a telegram issued by General Dupont,</item>
                </list>
                <p>represent the German Government as preparing to conduct municipal elections in
                    Upper Silesia very shortly.</p>
                <p>For these reasons, the Polish Affairs Commission has the honor to propose that
                    the Supreme Council communicate the letter hereto annexed to the German
                    Delegation.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Paris</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1919-10-27">October 27,
                        1919</date>.</dateline></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
